{"ID":"20240513083053-gjj7uo2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240513083053-gjj7uo2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083053-gjj7uo2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164739-ari80hu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164739-ari80hu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:545,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164739-ari80hu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:531,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:531\u0026#125;","title":"253","type":"doc","updated":"20240514163413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513164739-ari80hu","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 898px;","id":"20240513164739-ari80hu","updated":"20240514163413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：2008/04/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200-1 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16，瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"04/01/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自五、六歲開始，手足紅赤如火燒之感，額熱臉涼，月經正常。身體熱，手足時熱時好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"師問：體重有無增加。答曰：無。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→師問體重增減乃是欲查其寒熱，一般而言體重增加是有熱，體重減輕是有寒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n生理期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡時身溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無，會忘記喝水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"掌額溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"額熱但頰涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從不出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→師問完此問題後就立刻開四逆湯生附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身：其他："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虛數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽不足、肝有損傷(圈紋以及破洞)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虛熱、熱不入陰故上浮。(寒極生熱)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢 乾薑二錢 炙甘草四錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生地三錢 天花三錢 淮山三錢 山茱萸三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梔子三錢 黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、此人望診即為四逆(因手掌腳掌皆紅赤)，四逆之證並不一定指四肢冰冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、此人常將手足浸入冰水之中，但過不久反而更熱。(因寒會生大熱)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、問體重是因為裡寒之人不會變胖，而此人體型極瘦，更證明裡寒無疑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、此人陰陽俱虛，故必須同時開滋陰之藥，如同汽車電池若無水則電力無從蓄，因此陽也需陰之助以得守。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、此女心臟之營養無法入心，散至手足，因此四肢的紅色為心的營養。又此人從不出汗故知心臟有問題。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}